    "text": "47 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-03-04 22:21:00 CST Expires: 2026-03-04 22:31:00 CST Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Target Area: Kaufman, TX The storm which prompted the warning has weakened below severe limits. Therefore the warning will be allowed to expire. However gusty winds and heavy rain are still possible with this thunderstorm.\nA Severe Thunderstorm Watch remains in effect until 1100 PM CST for north central Texas.",
